commit e2324257
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 13:49:48 -0600
subject: feat(messages): capture upstream URL (B4) — real URLs in curl export

- buildRequestDetail: url pass-through (base/overrides, legacy-compat absent)
- chatCore + sub-handlers: thread providerUrl (authoritative executor URL) into
  all 8 capture sites, falling back to providerResponse?.url
  (providerResponse.url is empty for synthetic new Response() executors:
  codex/commandcode/cursor)
- repo flushToDatabase: persist url in data blob (no schema change)
- buildCurl: use detail.url with placeholder fallback for legacy rows
- tests: b4-curl-url-capture (5 tests) — forward/omit/override/curl/fallback


